{
    "background_story": "Misael was a respected leader in his small town, having served as a selectman for over a decade. His dedication to the community was evident in the countless hours he spent listening to residents' concerns and working to find solutions. As a selectman, Misael was known for his fairness and integrity, always putting the needs of the town ahead of personal interests. He played a key role in revitalizing the town's downtown area, bringing in new businesses and creating jobs for local residents. Misael's commitment to transparency and accountability earned him the trust of his constituents, who re-elected him time and again. Despite the demands of the role, he remained humble and approachable, always willing to lend a helping hand or offer guidance to those in need.",
